    "name": "Evidence, testimony and possible explanations",
    "description": "Extract exact observations and attributed claims, retain source quotes, propose hypotheses separately, check contradictions and append a spoiler-safe board while staging new evidence.\n\nSetup: Create public JSON evidence-board as []. Bind Prose and decision. Use public Scene Context, never the hidden solution. Write adds evidence by stable record ID with source references and evidence; conflicting IDs hold. The file records accepted observations/claims as such. A generated hypothesis remains a generated proposal and is never saved as established world truth.\n\nInspect: On Send owns this generation. Generate Reply uses the ordinary SillyTavern connection. Auxiliary roles remain unassigned in this portable example. Review the final narrative and proposed consequences; Apply publishes a new swipe and settles staged writes. Preview and bounded runs never settle.\n\nGenerated suggestions are proposals. Quoted observations preserve source identity; notes never establish canonical events. Private records cannot be appended to public notes.",
